  "content": "\n\n<p><strong>Croptopia Delight</strong>&nbsp;是&nbsp;<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a>&nbsp;的附加模组，实现了<strong>Farmer's Delight</strong>与<strong>Croptopia</strong>的整合。</p>\n<pre>本模组添加了 Croptopia 食谱与 Farmer's Delight 及其附属模组的整合。</pre>\n<p>在 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/ray_lirov\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ray_Lirov</a> 的带领下，开发工作已恢复。</p>\n<pre>您也可以使用<strong>数据包</strong>版本：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/croptopia-delight-dp\" rel=\"nofollow\">链接</a><br>我们还有 Modrinth 页面：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcroptopia-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">链接</a></pre>\n<p>有问题？加入我们的 Discord 并提问<br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/M4XttfXXDw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 链接</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>正在寻找游戏服务器托管服务？我们的合作伙伴 Godlike Host 可以帮到您！</strong></p>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgodlike.host%252fminecraft-java-servers-hosting%252f%253faff_id%253d1317\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/932098/description_8a000688-8d49-42cd-9370-104cd5ac9b97.png\" width=\"575\" height=\"300\"></a>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>",
